  rd_wb_print_confirm: { en: "Print {n} waybills now? They go to this computer's printer. On a laptop that prints stickers by itself, they print on the sticker printer.", fil: "I-print na ang {n} waybills? Mapupunta ito sa printer ng computer na ito. Sa laptop na kusang nagpi-print ng stickers, sa sticker printer ito lalabas.", zh: "现在打印 {n} 张运单吗？会送到这台电脑的打印机。若这台电脑会自动打印贴纸，就会印在贴纸打印机上。", "zh-TW": "現在列印 {n} 張託運單嗎？會送到這台電腦的印表機。若這台電腦會自動列印貼紙，就會印在貼紙印表機上。", vi: "Print {n} waybills now? They go to this computer's printer. On a laptop that prints stickers by itself, they print on the sticker printer.", th: "Print {n} waybills now? They go to this computer's printer. On a laptop that prints stickers by itself, they print on the sticker printer.", id: "Print {n} waybills now? They go to this computer's printer. On a laptop that prints stickers by itself, they print on the sticker printer.", bg: "Print {n} waybills now? They go to this computer's printer. On a laptop that prints stickers by itself, they print on the sticker printer." },
